1c:T461,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there an official TikTok Premium?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. TikTok is free with advertising and optional in-app purchases such as coins for live gifts. Any website offering a 'TikTok Premium' APK is distributing an unofficial, modified file that can harm your phone and get your account banned."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why does TikTok fill up my phone's storage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Videos you watch are cached so replays and scrolling feel instant, and that cache grows over time, especially on 32 GB phones. Clear it from TikTok's in-app settings — not by installing a 'cleaner' version from a random site."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is TikTok safe for teenagers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"TikTok sets age limits and offers a restricted mode, screen-time reminders, and Family Pairing so parents can link accounts. Even so, the feed is a general-audience mix, so teenagers do best with supervision, a private account, and agreed time limits."}}]}12:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home (EN)\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"TikTok\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/aplikasi/tiktok\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/60","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1","children":[["$","li","/en",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[false,["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/en","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"English Home"