23:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","TikTok is a short-video platform",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"TikTok is a short-video platform where anyone can record, edit, and watch vertical videos ranging from a few seconds to several minutes. Its For You feed learns what you watch, like, and skip, then serves more of it — which is why two people opening the same app see completely different worlds."}],["$","p","In Indonesia, TikTok is far more",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"In Indonesia, TikTok is far more than entertainment: it is where trends start, where small sellers reach buyers through TikTok Shop and live selling, and where quick tutorials rack up millions of views. This page covers the facts — features, permissions, and an honest look at safety — and links only to the official Google Play Store listing."}]]}]
24:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":["What ","TikTok"," Does"]}],[["$","p","Creators get a built-in camera w",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Creators get a built-in camera with face filters, AR effects, stickers, timers, and a large licensed music library. Videos can be recorded in the app or uploaded from the gallery, then trimmed, captioned, and layered with text and sounds. Features like Duet and Stitch let you respond to other videos side by side or build on a clip, when the original creator allows it."}],["$","p","Commerce is built in. In Indones",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Commerce is built in. In Indonesia, TikTok's shopping features run with Tokopedia, so sellers can pin products to videos and livestreams and viewers can check out without leaving the app. Live streaming adds real-time comments and virtual gifts, with age limits on who can broadcast. Many creators edit in CapCut — the companion editor from the same ecosystem — before posting."}]]]}]
25:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Safety & Privacy"}],[["$","p","The official TikTok app from Goo",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The official TikTok app from Google Play is signed by TikTok Pte. Ltd., passes Play Protect scanning, and updates directly from its developer. The real danger is unofficial builds: files calling themselves modded, ad-free, or 'Premium' TikTok come from random sites, are not on the Play Store, and commonly carry aggressive ads or data stealers. There is no official product called TikTok Premium."}],["$","p","On privacy, remember TikTok coll",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"On privacy, remember TikTok collects usage data to power recommendations and advertising, as its privacy policy states. Reduce your footprint with a private account if you prefer, limit who can message you, review app permissions now and then, and use Family Pairing plus screen-time limits for teenagers. Its cache also grows quickly on small phones, so clear it from the in-app settings regularly."}]]]}]
